  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie wipes Carefree Island’s competition round on Central Continent, Hei Lou Lan shatters the immortal formation at the upper stream of scale light river, and Bai Ning Bing freezes the stage in Hundred segment forest. Fang Yuan treats those three as elites among rank seven Gu Immortals after future self is used on them.",
      "chapters": [
        1704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court keeps Duke Long unmoved while the convention continues. Fang Yuan judges that Shadow Sect alone cannot stop the competition unless another strong force joins, and Longevity Heaven still does not answer in time. For each plundered resource point he puts up the video in treasure yellow heaven for other Gu Immortals to see; Western Desert, Southern Border, Eastern Sea, and Northern Plains Gu Immortals join the pressure while Heavenly Court still pushes the convention.",
      "chapters": [
        1704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_duke_long",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Man Zheng Yuan spends piled human will on People’s United Hearts, linking Central Continent hearts so infiltrators at competition grounds are exposed and cleared. Wu Yong then leads Southern Alliance immortals against Infallible blessed land to seize success dao marks and block fate Gu’s full restoration.",
      "chapters": [
        1705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_man_zheng_yuan",
        "move_peoples_united_hearts",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "fac_southern_alliance",
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The field is Central Continent, Emperor City, the convention finals site where Immortal Gu Houses ring the city, and Western Desert rank eights arrive with their own Houses.",
      "chapters": [
        1707
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_emperor_city",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1708 is titled Emperor City Battlefield and continues that Immortal Gu House clash. In the same Emperor City stretch, Heavenly Lotus Sect’s Houses are Canary Pavilion and Yue Yang Palace, Ancient Soul Sect’s is Frost Dragon Manor, and Wind Cloud Manor’s is Wind Sweeping Building.",
      "chapters": [
        1708
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "house_canary_pavilion",
        "house_yue_yang_palace",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
        "house_frost_dragon_manor",
        "house_wind_cloud_manor",
        "house_wind_sweeping_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ancient Soul Sect stations Yang Feng at spirit bank spring; Forgotten Daoist takes the spring water after wiping Yang Feng’s memory of the theft.",
      "chapters": [
        1705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An immemorial immortal material en route to Immortal Crane Sect is attacked midway and stolen by mysterious Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1704
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Yi is named as Heavenly Lotus Sect’s previous first supreme elder during the war stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-path-convention-under-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_yi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei names Western Desert and Southern Border main forces as already committed, and Longevity Heaven’s Calamity Luck Altar bursts into Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1707
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Longevity Heaven’s Calamity Luck Altar then fights inside Heavenly Court along Limitless Demon Venerable’s left path, and chapter 1711 titles the field Heavenly Court Battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan names Infallible blessed land as the remaining hope once fate Gu still lacks its final success dao marks, and Fang Yuan turns from Emperor City toward that battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        1727
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turn-to-infallible-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_sai_chuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prince Feng Xian, stationed outside Infallible blessed land with Ba Shi Ba, is named as Spirit Affinity House’s spy.",
      "chapters": [
        1728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turn-to-infallible-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "char_ba_shi_ba",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower later uses Fate Vanquish after Heavenly Court restores rank nine fate Gu, and Longevity Heaven’s side takes heavy losses before retreating.",
      "chapters": [
        1742
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-on-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "move_fate_vanquish"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fate Vanquish is a rank nine killer move. Fang Yuan then treats Di Zang Sheng’s stall of Duke Long as the opening to breach Heaven Overseeing Tower and destroy fate Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-on-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_di_zang_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin, Paradise Earth’s inheritor, blocks Southern and Northern immortals alone on the Infallible field and forces Fang Yuan’s side into a perilous stand. Spirit Affinity House then sends Zhao Lian Yun out from its headquarters while enemies are fleeing. Chapter 1746 is titled Bai Ning Bing’s Betrayal.",
      "chapters": [
        1746
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-on-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1747 is titled Star Constellation’s Sacrifice, and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable assimilates with the Dao so her will can influence heaven’s will and keep fate Gu in Heavenly Court’s grasp.",
      "chapters": [
        1747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-on-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1748 is titled Duke Long’s Sacrifice; in a past memory told to Red Lotus, Duke Long used Dragonman Extermination to wipe the dragonman race as righteous-path sacrifice, and on the Infallible field he uses that same move to kill Bai Ning Bing inside Dragon Palace.",
      "chapters": [
        1748
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-on-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_dragonman_extermination",
        "house_dragon_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Spring Autumn Cicada returns a future clone’s will, Fang Yuan states that the attempt failed and Heavenly Court still repaired fate Gu completely.",
      "chapters": [
        1749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-gu-attempt-outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later fate stakes continue in Destroying Fate.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-gu-attempt-outcome",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_fate_destruction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane Sect and Black Heaven Temple are named as part of Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects when floating life fire changes hands between their immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1756
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-great-ancient-sects",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_black_heaven_temple",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He refines a dragonman clone inside his sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1803
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship then enters the River of Time, and Fairy Zi Wei receives the report in Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1805
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His dragonman clone later dives for Immortal Gu House Dragon Palace inside an Eastern Sea dream realm, with the main body standing guard above.",
      "chapters": [
        1826
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside that dream realm the clone, as Wu Shuai, contests Green Ant Ascetic’s ant-manipulation disciple test against Tai Qin and suspects the dream realm requires a loss.",
      "chapters": [
        1830
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_green_ant_ascetic",
        "char_tai_qin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1831 is titled Heavenly Court Notices, and the Court’s attention turns onto the dragonman blessed land that exposes Dragon Palace.",
      "chapters": [
        1831
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Dragon Palace thread then runs unbroken to chapter 1849, titled Ancestor of the New Dragonman, which closes the range.",
      "chapters": [
        1849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-convention-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
